From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charlie <5764343+charlielye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:58:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] chore: bump playwright to 1.63.0

Chromium 131, which playwright 1.49 ships, cannot compile wasm that uses
standard (exnref) exception handling, and fails with "invalid value type
'exn', enable with --experimental-wasm-exnref". aztec-packages is moving
bb's wasm to exnref and its CI image to playwright 1.63.0 browsers
(Chromium 153), which compile it. The 1.49 pins also point at browsers
that image no longer installs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G5s7nEWrYapDK2CWpEzcAf

